cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  probityai: check what an AI agent did, from the bytes, before you trust it
message: >-
  Cite the package release you ran (its version on PyPI) and the commit it was built from.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gilda
    given-names: Sankalp
    email: sankalp.gilda@gmail.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3645-4501'
repository-code: https://github.com/probityai/probity
abstract: >-
  Command-line tools and libraries that decide a claim about an agent run against pinned evidence or a DSSE envelope, record agent actions as signed, retained evidence, and turn an observed agent failure into a guard proven by replay.
keywords:
  - agent evidence
  - verification
  - signed records
  - offline verification
  - agentic systems
license: Apache-2.0
